@startuml
title FR-05 - Register Blood Bank Staff - Activity Diagram

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond

|Blood Bank HRM or\nBlood Bank Administrator|
start
:Request staff registration;

|Client|
:Display the required account fields;

|Blood Bank HRM or\nBlood Bank Administrator|
:Enter staff details and select a role\nwithin the blood bank;

if (Cancel registration before saving?) then ([Yes])
  :Cancel registration;
  stop
else ([No])
  :Click the submit button;
endif

|Server — Accounts|
:Validate the entered data and login identifier\nagainst the account rules;

if (Data invalid or login identifier\nconflicts with account rules?) then ([Yes])
  :Reject registration;

  |Client|
  :Display the registration rejection reason;
  stop
else ([No])
endif

|Server — Accounts|
:Create the staff account and assign it\nto the selected blood bank and role;

|Client|
:Display registration confirmation;
stop

@enduml